### **2. Frontend (React) Improvements**  
#### **🔹 Real-Time HDD Status Updates**  
- **Problem:** Scans run in the background, but the UI doesn’t reflect progress.  
- **Fix:** Use **WebSockets (FastAPI’s `WebSocketEndpoint`)** + **React polling**.  
  ```jsx
  // Frontend: Auto-refresh scan status every 5s
  const [scanData, setScanData] = useState(null);
  useEffect(() => {
      const interval = setInterval(async () => {
          const res = await axios.get("/api/hdd-status");
          setScanData(res.data);
      }, 5000);
      return () => clearInterval(interval);
  }, []);
  ```  

#### **🔹 Better Export UX (PDF/CSV)**  
- **Problem:** Large logs freeze the UI during export.  
- **Fix:**  
  - **Backend:** Stream CSV/PDF instead of generating in-memory.  
  - **Frontend:** Show a progress bar with `axios` + `onDownloadProgress`.  
  ```jsx
  const exportLogs = async (format) => {
      const res = await axios.get(`/admin/export-logs?format=${format}`, {
          responseType: "blob",
          onDownloadProgress: (p) => {
              const percent = Math.round((p.loaded / p.total) * 100);
              setExportProgress(percent);
          },
      });
      // Download file
      const url = window.URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([res.data]));
      const link = document.createElement("a");
      link.href = url;
      link.setAttribute("download", `logs_${Date.now()}.${format}`);
      document.body.appendChild(link);
      link.click();
  };
  ```  

#### **🔹 Persistent Theme Preference**  
- **Problem:** Theme resets on page reload.  
- **Fix:** Save to `localStorage` + **React context**.  
  ```jsx
  // ThemeContext.jsx
  const ThemeContext = createContext();

  export const ThemeProvider = ({ children }) => {
      const [theme, setTheme] = useState(localStorage.getItem("theme") || "light");
      
      const toggleTheme = () => {
          const newTheme = theme === "light" ? "dark" : "light";
          setTheme(newTheme);
          localStorage.setItem("theme", newTheme);
      };

      return (
          <ThemeContext.Provider value={{ theme, toggleTheme }}>
              {children}
          </ThemeContext.Provider>
      );
  };
  ```  

